T = x · y = y · x & x ∘ (x · y) = y ∘ x & (x ∘ y) · z = y · (z · x)
  T => x ∘ y = y ∘ x            proved (Theorem)
  T => (x · y) · z = x · (y · z) proved (Theorem)
  T => x · (y · z) = y · (x · z) proved (Theorem)
  T => (x · y) · z = (x ∘ y) · z proved (Theorem)
  T => x ∘ (x · y) = x ∘ y      proved (Theorem)
  T => x · (x · y) = x · (y · y) proved (Theorem)
  T => (x ∘ y) ∘ z = x ∘ (y ∘ z) proved (Theorem)
  T => x ∘ (x ∘ y) = x ∘ y      proved (Theorem)
  T => x · x = x ∘ x            unknown (ResourceOut)
  T => x · y = x ∘ y            unknown (ResourceOut)
  T => x · x = x                unknown (ResourceOut)
  T => x ∘ x = x                unknown (ResourceOut)
  T => x · (x · x) = x · x      unknown (ResourceOut)
  T => x · x = y · y            unknown (ResourceOut)
  T => x ∘ (y · z) = x ∘ (y ∘ z) proved (Theorem)
  T => (x · y) ∘ z = (x ∘ y) ∘ z proved (Theorem)
  T => (x ∘ y) · z = x ∘ (y · z) unknown (ResourceOut)
  T => x · (y ∘ z) = x ∘ (y · z) unknown (ResourceOut)
  T => (x · y) · z = (x ∘ y) ∘ z unknown (ResourceOut)
  T => x ∘ (x ∘ x) = x ∘ x      proved (Theorem)
  T => x · (x · x) = (x ∘ x) ∘ x unknown (ResourceOut)
K = x · y = y · x & x ∘ y = y ∘ x & x ∘ (x · y) = x ∘ y & (x · y) · z = x · (y · z) & (x · y) · z = (x ∘ y) · z
  T => K True | K => T True
K3 = x · y = y · x & x ∘ y = y ∘ x & x ∘ (x ∘ y) = x ∘ y & x · (y · z) = x · (y ∘ z) & x ∘ (y · z) = x ∘ (y ∘ z) & (x · y) · z = x · (y · z) & (x ∘ y) ∘ z = x ∘ (y ∘ z)
  T => K3 True | K3 => T True
  K4 (K3 without x∘(x∘y)=x∘y) => x ∘ (x ∘ y) = x ∘ y  unknown (ResourceOut)
  K4 (K3 without x∘(x∘y)=x∘y) => x · (x · y) = x · (y · y) unknown (ResourceOut)
  K4 (K3 without x∘(x∘y)=x∘y) => x ∘ (x · y) = y ∘ x  unknown (ResourceOut)
  T => (x ∘ y) · z = x ∘ (y · z) (dimonoid D3) unknown (ResourceOut)
  T => x · (y ∘ z) = (x · y) ∘ z (dimonoid D3) unknown (ResourceOut)
  T => (x · y) · z = (x ∘ y) ∘ z (dimonoid D3) unknown (ResourceOut)
